      "literal_Notes": [
        {
          "A1": {
            "value": "This file contains selected federal and state election results as certified by the State Canvassing Board on November 21, 2024 and results of a recount of State Representative District 54A updated December 2, 2024. Includes special election for Minnesota Senate District 45. Voter statistics are those certified by County Canvassing Boards. In statistics for some mail ballot precincts in Clearwater, Swift, and Winona counties, some polling place statistics (\"Signatures\") may be higher than than they should be and absentee/mail ballot statistics (\"AB_MB\") lower. \nThe Precinct Results table has all the precinct information, voting statistics, and election results. The Fields table explains the abbreviations used in the column headings in the Precinct Results table. The Counties table shows county names and codes. The Districts worksheet has information on certain districts, including code-to-name cross-references for the Soil and Water Conservation District and Hospital District codes used in the Precinct Results table. \nThe \"TABMODEL\" field for each precinct shows the tabulation equipment used for polling place votes, or the equipment used for absentee and mail votes in the case of mail ballot precincts. The Voting Equipment by County worksheet shows equipment that each county used to tabulate absentee and mail ballots, and used as assistive voting equipment. The absentee and mail ballot equipment may have been used for in person early voting and/or ballots returned by mail.",
            "type": "s",
            "formula": null
          }
        },
        {
          "A2": {
            "value": "End of worksheet",
            "type": "s",
            "formula": null
          }
        }
      ]
