          "A1": {
            "value": "This file contains selected federal and state election results as certified by the State Canvassing Board on November 29, 2022 and results of recounts of State Representative Districts 3A and 3B as certified by the State Canvassing Board on December 15, 2022. Voter statistics are those certified by County Canvassing Boards.\nThe Precinct Results table has all the precinct information, voting statistics, and election results. The Fields table explains the abbreviations used in the column headings in the Precinct Results table. The Counties table shows county names and codes. The Districts worksheet has information on certain districts, including code-to-name cross-references for the Soil and Water Conservation District and Hospital District codes used in the Precinct Results table. \nThe \"TABMODEL\" field for each precinct shows the tabulation equipment used for polling place votes, or the equipment used for absentee and mail votes in the case of mail ballot precincts. The Voting Equipment by County worksheet shows equipment that each county used to tabulate absentee and mail ballots, and as assistive voting equipment. The absentee and mail ballot equipment may have been used for in person early voting and/or ballots returned by mail. Assistive equipment was updated for some counties on 1/18/23.",
